不即殺。」生送詣勔，勔躬自慰勞，詰其叛逆，對曰：「九州唱義，豈獨在我。」勔又問：「四方阻逆，無戰不禽，主上皆加以曠蕩，即其才用。卿何不早歸天闕，乃逃命草間乎？」靈越答曰：「薛公舉兵淮北，威震天下，不能專任智勇，委付子姪，致敗之由，實在於此。然事之始末，備皆參豫，人生歸於一死，實無面求活。」勔壯其意，送還京師。太宗欲加原宥，靈越辭對如一，終不回改，乃殺之。靈越，清河人也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"王廣之","kind":"person","person_id":"m4d_lon_pyg","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"劉勔","kind":"person","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"殷琰","kind":"person","person_id":"mj8_5ic_4kk_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"傅靈越","kind":"person","person_id":"kfw_r30_lgz","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"廣之","kind":"person","person_id":"m4d_lon_pyg","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:u0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"軍人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"王廣之部下，姓名、人數未詳。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"傅靈越","kind":"person","person_id":"kfw_r30_lgz","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:u0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"汝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"靈越呼擒獲者；未能定位到具名者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"勔","kind":"person","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"勔","kind":"person","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songsh